Package: biblioIntegrator
Type: Package
Title: Harmonized, Comparative and Network-Based Bibliometric Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Walter Esfrain", "Pereira", email = "walterufpb@yahoo.com.br", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1085-0191")),
    person("Magali Haidee", "Pereira Martinez", role = "aut", comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-5419-959X"))
    )
Description: Provides a reproducible R-first workflow for importing, harmonizing,
    auditing, comparing, mapping and interpreting bibliographic data. It supports
    comparative inference for user-defined groups, network analysis, temporal and
    text summaries, provenance tracking, open scholarly APIs, and optional backends
    for 'bibliometrix', 'biblionetwork', Apache Arrow, DuckDB and Python 'Biblium'.
    Optional engines are detected at run time and are never required for core use.
